      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay, that makes sense. i was worried it was something serious but you're probably right. i've also been feeling a bit nauseous and my stomach feels kind of heavy/crampy. do you think i should take some ibuprofen for the stomach stuff or should i just keep drinking the coconut water?",
